WEBVTT

00:00:16.930 --> 00:00:18.470
Were you still awake?

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:32.110
I had a feeling that you would come.

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.840
<b>After War</b>

00:00:50.550 --> 00:00:55.840
<b>GUNDAM</b>

00:00:55.840 --> 00:01:03.340
<b>The dream I'd nearly forgotten is beginning to stir,</b>

00:01:03.340 --> 00:01:06.300
<b>little by little</b>

00:01:06.300 --> 00:01:10.850
<b>filling in the gaps in my heart</b>

00:01:10.850 --> 00:01:18.250
<b>The instant my frozen memories begin to awaken,</b>

00:01:18.250 --> 00:01:27.750
<b>my only wish is for the future that is about to begin</b>

00:01:27.750 --> 00:01:31.290
<b>I'll reach out with both hands</b>

00:01:31.290 --> 00:01:35.290
<b>and embrace that dream I once had</b>

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:38.930
<b>I want to go on believing</b>

00:01:38.930 --> 00:01:42.840
<b>without ever letting go or giving up</b>

00:01:42.840 --> 00:01:46.480
<b>Until the day comes when I grab hold...</b>

00:01:46.480 --> 00:01:50.340
<b>...of that dream I once had,</b>

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:53.890
<b>I want to keep chasing after it</b>

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:59.780
<b>without ever forgetting my hopes and dreams</b>

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:10.040
<b>Episode 8</b>

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:10.040
<b>"I'll Make that Boy Pay!"</b>

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:27.890
Aim for the cockpit! Roast the pilot alive!

00:03:02.930 --> 00:03:04.430
Now's my chance!

00:03:09.560 --> 00:03:14.150
Damn it! Chase after him! Get those gold bars back!

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:16.150
Captain, it's no use!

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:20.190
Clock Squad, all units hit! They can't pursue!

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:22.410
Crap!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:30.460
Big Bro, I kept your treasure safe.

00:03:31.870 --> 00:03:33.710
Man, what a mess...

00:03:33.830 --> 00:03:38.960
I can't exactly carry these around until I find a new hiding spot.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:43.800
If it isn't my savior!

00:03:43.890 --> 00:03:46.350
I don't know who you are, but you saved my hide!

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:53.140
Was he thanking us? What a laugh.

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:56.270
Yes, we didn't spare his life.

00:04:09.740 --> 00:04:12.160
How long are you going to keep quiet?

00:04:12.250 --> 00:04:17.000
Your plan was to take me out and get the GX for free, right?

00:04:19.250 --> 00:04:21.510
Tell me the truth, damn it!

00:04:21.800 --> 00:04:24.510
You really want to get the truth out of me?

00:04:26.470 --> 00:04:28.010
Don't move!

00:04:28.140 --> 00:04:30.220
You have nowhere to go back to, right?

00:04:30.310 --> 00:04:32.390
Don't move, I said!

00:04:32.560 --> 00:04:34.810
You have no one waiting for you, right?

00:04:34.890 --> 00:04:36.980
I mean it, I'll shoot!

00:04:37.360 --> 00:04:40.480
Being by yourself is lonely.

00:04:59.130 --> 00:05:02.130
The next one won't miss. Beat it!

00:05:17.690 --> 00:05:18.940
I won't miss, either.

00:05:35.540 --> 00:05:37.620
Did you find the GX?

00:05:40.170 --> 00:05:43.210
From the look of it, I'd say that's a "No".

00:05:43.300 --> 00:05:47.170
As soon as my mobile suits are repaired, I'll resume the search for the GX.

00:05:47.680 --> 00:05:50.340
Until then, kick back and get some rest.

00:05:53.510 --> 00:05:55.270
How about some wine?

00:05:58.560 --> 00:06:00.310
W-What was that for?

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:06.780
If you don't want any, just say so.

00:06:14.790 --> 00:06:17.540
I'll make that boy pay!

00:06:23.630 --> 00:06:25.710
The Leopard is here!

00:06:27.210 --> 00:06:28.670
What's wrong?

00:06:29.970 --> 00:06:32.550
What's the Airmaster doing with him?

00:06:32.970 --> 00:06:37.020
I was looking for the Freeden, too. Lucky for me that I ran into you.

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.730
If you say so...

00:06:40.810 --> 00:06:45.690
Say what?! Jamil's on mandatory bed rest, and the GX is gone?!

00:06:46.030 --> 00:06:49.610
We wouldn't be hiding out in this forest otherwise.

00:06:50.490 --> 00:06:53.410
That's why I hired Roabea to provide security.

00:06:53.530 --> 00:06:56.080
No kidding... Crap.

00:06:56.580 --> 00:06:58.410
That was a miscalculation.

00:06:58.500 --> 00:06:59.460
Miscalculation?

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:02.670
He said something about leaving something important with you.

00:07:03.170 --> 00:07:04.710
What's so important?

00:07:09.760 --> 00:07:11.380
You idiot!

00:07:19.390 --> 00:07:21.640
Would you look at that!

00:07:22.190 --> 00:07:25.360
You were going to leave those with us?!

00:07:26.190 --> 00:07:28.980
I have to say, I'm amazed that you amassed so much.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:33.360
Hey, maybe I'll kill you...

00:07:33.410 --> 00:07:34.570
Quit it!

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:38.740
This gold is my life! If anyone touches it, they're dead!

00:07:41.910 --> 00:07:44.670
If we touch it, we're dead, huh?

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:48.710
So, did you decide to look after this treasure of his?

00:07:48.840 --> 00:07:53.680
Yes. In return, I've hired him for security until the Captain recovers.

00:07:55.050 --> 00:07:58.680
He's making good progress. The wartime generation is built tough.

00:07:59.680 --> 00:08:01.180
I hope you're right.

00:08:10.400 --> 00:08:12.530
That's quite a scowl.

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:16.950
Acting Captain is a tough job. It's not surprising.

00:08:17.830 --> 00:08:18.990
Yes...

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:24.750
I'm letting myself in!

00:08:24.790 --> 00:08:25.710
Whatever.

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:28.170
What?

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:33.670
Kid found something you dropped and asked me to give it to you. This!

00:08:36.890 --> 00:08:40.640
They're your siblings, aren't they? I could tell right away!

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.930
You've got the same face!

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:44.060
Drop it!

00:08:44.520 --> 00:08:47.150
I never pegged you for a homebody!

00:08:47.270 --> 00:08:51.820
Your youngest brother is your spitting image!

00:08:53.280 --> 00:08:54.950
Wh-What did I say?

00:08:55.070 --> 00:09:00.120
My youngest brother, he... Bastel Sou passed away.

00:09:01.700 --> 00:09:03.580
He died two years ago.

00:09:04.710 --> 00:09:06.920
Colony Sickness.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:16.930
You know, I think you've gotten even prettier!

00:09:18.340 --> 00:09:20.850
Do you really mean that?

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.480
Don't toy with my feelings.

00:09:29.690 --> 00:09:31.480
Sorry.

00:09:40.070 --> 00:09:41.780
If you're avoiding Sara, she's left.

00:09:47.410 --> 00:09:50.420
That wasn't nice, what you did earlier.

00:09:51.380 --> 00:09:55.460
It would hurt anyone's feelings if that was done to them.

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:57.300
I didn't mean to.

00:09:58.800 --> 00:10:01.800
Come to think of it, I wonder what Garrod is up to?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:06.520
Try to put yourself in his shoes a little.

00:10:06.640 --> 00:10:09.270
Put myself in his shoes?

00:10:09.850 --> 00:10:13.230
And I guess not just Garrod's.

00:10:14.190 --> 00:10:16.070
It's the same with everyone else.

00:10:16.570 --> 00:10:21.370
When you grow up, you have to keep lots of things bottled up inside.

00:10:42.140 --> 00:10:45.140
You'll figure it out over time, I guess.

00:10:56.530 --> 00:11:01.950
Put myself in others' shoes. Understand people's feelings.

00:11:03.200 --> 00:11:05.120
Garrod...

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.430
Being by yourself is lonely.

00:11:28.310 --> 00:11:29.850
Tell me about it.

00:11:33.690 --> 00:11:35.810
Mobile suit tune-ups?

00:11:35.940 --> 00:11:38.820
Sure, I can do that, but I don't come cheap!

00:11:39.230 --> 00:11:45.700
You see, I work on those famous Gundams! Two of them, in fact!

00:11:46.580 --> 00:11:47.410
Brother.

00:11:47.490 --> 00:11:50.700
Yes, I didn't expect to run into him so soon.

00:11:50.830 --> 00:11:53.330
What, you know them?

00:11:56.130 --> 00:11:59.130
Something like that. Right, Brother?

00:11:59.210 --> 00:12:00.340
More or less.

00:12:15.100 --> 00:12:20.480
All mobile suits, prepare for launch! Use all our resources to find the GX!

00:12:20.610 --> 00:12:22.440
That won't be necessary.

00:12:22.950 --> 00:12:26.620
I have a plan. Will you let me handle this?

00:12:26.740 --> 00:12:28.740
You do, Ennil?

00:12:29.910 --> 00:12:31.330
Okay, I'll follow your lead.

00:12:34.580 --> 00:12:37.920
That boy is still attached to his crewmates! So we use that!

00:12:50.010 --> 00:12:52.680
The Airmaster's in worse shape than I thought!

00:12:53.770 --> 00:12:57.150
Power circuit fuses throughout the frame are melted from the heat.

00:12:57.270 --> 00:13:00.650
Damn it all... May as well do an overhaul, then.

00:13:25.380 --> 00:13:28.010
I knew it, I'm being followed...

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:46.030
Hey.

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:47.650
Is there a problem?

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:48.700
Not at all!

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.580
Nice weather today, huh?

00:13:51.830 --> 00:13:52.790
Yes.

00:14:00.250 --> 00:14:03.800
In profile, you look a lot like my late wife.

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:06.170
I hear that line a lot.

00:14:07.010 --> 00:14:08.880
Should've gone with "first love," huh?

00:14:08.880 --> 00:14:10.300
I hate jokes.

00:14:11.050 --> 00:14:12.970
Want to grab a bite sometime?

00:14:13.010 --> 00:14:14.060
Give it a rest.

00:14:14.140 --> 00:14:15.680
I was being serious.

00:14:23.320 --> 00:14:26.110
Run! Hurry! Run!

00:14:26.820 --> 00:14:28.900
Hey, that was rude!

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:30.570
What the...?

00:14:34.580 --> 00:14:37.000
An attack? Hurry up and fix it!

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.500
I said it'll be a while yet!

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:40.830
I'm going in!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:43.090
Roabea! Damn it...

00:14:46.050 --> 00:14:47.710
Time for me to show my stuff.

00:14:55.180 --> 00:14:57.600
A different Gundam, huh? Spread out!

00:15:00.020 --> 00:15:02.940
Is it just me, or is Roabea more enthusiastic than usual today?

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:04.110
You think so?

00:15:04.190 --> 00:15:06.860
At this rate, we won't need to provide support fire.

00:15:06.980 --> 00:15:08.610
Or send in Witz.

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:14.030
Damn it, if that bum Roabea gets too cocky, he'll get himself hurt!

00:15:17.740 --> 00:15:19.580
I'll deal with you all at once.

00:15:30.470 --> 00:15:32.970
Info brokers, are you in position?

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.510
Wait, I know you!

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:15.090
I'm here for the Gundam!

00:16:15.800 --> 00:16:17.550
Like I'd give it to you!

00:16:17.680 --> 00:16:18.720
Eat this!

00:16:31.360 --> 00:16:35.110
You messed with me, and it's gonna cost you.

00:16:35.240 --> 00:16:38.280
Now, where did you hide the GX?

00:16:39.080 --> 00:16:41.410
Sorry, that gave me amnesia.

00:16:41.950 --> 00:16:43.580
Shock therapy!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:45.620
You remember now?

00:16:45.670 --> 00:16:47.710
R-Remember what?

00:16:48.040 --> 00:16:51.000
You won't remember unless I rough you up some more, huh?

00:16:52.710 --> 00:16:56.430
Have it your way, then!

00:17:02.470 --> 00:17:04.640
W-Wait! Don't shoot me!

00:17:10.110 --> 00:17:12.190
Who are you?

00:17:13.240 --> 00:17:14.240
You!

00:17:14.320 --> 00:17:17.240
You remember me, I'm honored.

00:17:17.320 --> 00:17:22.410
This is my big brother, Shagia Frost. Pilot of the Gundam Virsago.

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:26.830
It's nice to meet you. I wanted to have a leisurely chat with you.

00:17:29.210 --> 00:17:34.010
Don't be stupid. I'm not interested in fighting you without your suit.

00:17:34.300 --> 00:17:39.430
How about some tea to celebrate our reunion? Your treat, of course.

00:17:48.150 --> 00:17:49.520
You're not getting away!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:02.450
Oh, dear... Are we playing hide and seek now?

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:12.590
It was a setup, huh?

00:18:13.630 --> 00:18:15.920
Things aren't going to go your way anymore.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:17.340
Fry him!

00:18:32.730 --> 00:18:35.280
This is one strange job!

00:18:35.360 --> 00:18:39.610
We just have to go to town and make a scene, saying that Gundams are fighting!

00:18:39.740 --> 00:18:41.990
I'll do anything as long as there's money in it!

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.460
You've quit piloting the GX?

00:18:49.580 --> 00:18:53.840
Not just the Gundam. I'm not going back to that ship, either.

00:18:53.920 --> 00:18:56.340
That won't do at all, Brother.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:01.050
We'd like you to pilot the GX until your death, actually.

00:19:01.180 --> 00:19:02.180
My death?

00:19:02.340 --> 00:19:07.140
Yes. We'll defeat your Gundams and blow you to kingdom come.

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:10.480
That is what we Frost Brothers are after.

00:19:10.600 --> 00:19:11.980
Come again?

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:15.480
We've never lost to anyone.

00:19:15.570 --> 00:19:18.440
The sole exception is our recent battle.

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:22.610
Our sense of style won't let that stand.

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:27.290
So you see, you must pilot your Gundam.

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:29.540
Don't tell me what to do!

00:19:30.040 --> 00:19:32.790
If your beef is with me, what do you care about the Gundam?

00:19:33.670 --> 00:19:34.790
Don't get too full of yourself!

00:19:34.790 --> 00:19:35.630
What?

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:40.170
You won with the GX's capabilities, not your own skill.

00:19:41.380 --> 00:19:46.680
Are you sure? If you underestimate me, I think you might regret it.

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:51.140
Actually, we would hate for you to underestimate us.

00:19:57.190 --> 00:19:59.070
Have I proven my point?

00:19:59.150 --> 00:20:00.740
You'll pilot your Gundam?

00:20:01.240 --> 00:20:02.240
No.

00:20:02.280 --> 00:20:04.160
Then you leave us no choice.

00:20:05.280 --> 00:20:07.280
We'll attack the Freeden.

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:12.210
Knock yourselves out. I couldn't care less.

00:20:12.540 --> 00:20:14.080
Is that so?

00:20:14.710 --> 00:20:16.670
Are there any Vultures around?

00:20:16.880 --> 00:20:18.670
I've got a business proposal!

00:20:18.710 --> 00:20:22.670
There's a firefight in the forest, with a Gundam-type defending some ship!

00:20:22.720 --> 00:20:24.470
Someone beat us to it?

00:20:24.550 --> 00:20:27.050
What's the matter? I thought you couldn't care less.

00:20:28.510 --> 00:20:30.020
Yeah...

00:20:42.650 --> 00:20:45.610
I-It'll take more than this!

00:20:51.450 --> 00:20:52.620
Sorry for the wait!

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:54.080
It's too soon!

00:20:54.870 --> 00:20:56.960
I'll take these guys out for good this time!

00:21:06.680 --> 00:21:09.260
Where's the rest of their mobile suits?

00:21:09.350 --> 00:21:10.430
What?

00:21:17.600 --> 00:21:18.980
There's no way out?

00:21:19.110 --> 00:21:23.610
That's right! It's not just us, the ship is trapped, too!

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:27.110
So that was their plan.

00:21:27.780 --> 00:21:29.370
What do we do?

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:33.580
I wish I could say we could manage if we stopped the spread of the fire...

00:21:34.330 --> 00:21:36.120
But it's probably hopeless...

00:21:43.710 --> 00:21:45.220
That boy will come.

00:21:45.590 --> 00:21:48.470
Garrod Ran will definitely come!

00:21:53.100 --> 00:21:54.680
Damn it!

00:21:55.270 --> 00:21:58.190
You're right! I forgot to get a picture!

00:21:58.310 --> 00:22:00.230
That's not what I meant!

00:22:03.320 --> 00:22:05.570
You will come, Garrod.

00:22:05.650 --> 00:22:07.900
Our sense of style demands it.

00:22:12.200 --> 00:22:14.870
I have no choice but to go?

00:22:34.510 --> 00:22:36.390
I have to go!

00:22:45.440 --> 00:22:50.740
<b>Can I find the words to tell you</b>

00:22:47.490 --> 00:22:50.150
The Gundam X returns to the Freeden...

00:22:50.150 --> 00:22:54.320
...only to face an all-out attack by the Frost Brothers and the Zakot Gang.

00:22:50.740 --> 00:22:56.120
<b>How I live between the walls of steel and stone</b>

00:22:54.320 --> 00:22:57.610
Garrod and the others pull together and fight back,

00:22:57.610 --> 00:23:02.580
but Jamil's absence is felt, and they are faced with unprecedented danger.

00:22:57.790 --> 00:23:03.960
<b>How I close my eyes to find some kind of rapture</b>

00:23:04.670 --> 00:23:10.300
<b>In a world where you can feel so all alone</b>

00:23:11.970 --> 00:23:17.310
<b>Inside I'm full of light and laughter</b>

00:23:18.770 --> 00:23:21.190
<b>There's a flame that burns in me</b>

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:22.150
<b>(I need a way)</b>

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:26.230
<b>(I need a way) I need a way to set it free</b>

00:23:26.230 --> 00:23:31.150
<b>When you find love in your heart</b>

00:23:31.150 --> 00:23:33.280
<b>(The human touch)</b>

00:23:33.280 --> 00:23:37.330
<b>You can believe from the start</b>

00:23:37.330 --> 00:23:39.330
<b>(From the start)</b>

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:42.460
<b>Dreams they come true</b>

00:23:42.460 --> 00:23:43.830
<b>(They come true)</b>

00:23:43.830 --> 00:23:48.170
<b>All comes to you, oh all at once</b>

00:23:48.170 --> 00:23:51.970
<b>If you believe in human touch</b>

00:23:49.260 --> 00:23:51.090
As it rains in the streets...

00:23:51.090 --> 00:23:56.140
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:23:51.090 --> 00:23:56.140
<b>"As it Rains in the Streets..."</b>

00:23:56.140 --> 00:23:58.140
<b></b>
